    "summary": "Added paid-only Mistral Large 4 with text and image input, tool calling, and reasoning. Requests use direct Mistral inference with an automatic Mistral-pinned Vercel fallback; neither route uses Pollinations GPU. Input, cached-input, and output are billed per million tokens, with multiplier 1 and no aliases. Fixed native reasoning responses and request controls. Streaming, JSON/schema responses, and native and Messages endpoints were verified; the Responses API is unsupported. Cache handling was verified, but no prompt-cache benefit was observed.",
